<section>
	<h2 id="proteusthemes-options">ProteusThemes Options</h2>
	<p>You can find all theme options in the Customizer: <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Customize</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>[PT] Theme Options</samp></kbd></kbd>. This is a live preview editor for your page.</p>
	<p>Here you can change:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><b>Logo</b></li>
		<li><b>Header</b></li>
		<li><b>Navigation</b></li>
		<li><b>Sticky Menu</b></li>
		<li><b>Page Header Area</b></li>
		<li><b>Theme Layout &amp; Colors</b></li>
		<li><b>Footer</b></li>
		<li><b>Custom Code</b></li>
		<li><b>Shop</b> (when WooCommerce is active)</li>
		<li><b>Other</b></li>
	</ul>
	<p>Use <b>Navigation &gt; Featured page</b> for the header button. Choose a page, and the button shows the page title and links to it. To set your own text and link, choose <b>Custom URL</b> instead, then fill in <b>Custom Button Text</b> and <b>Custom URL</b>. You can also open the link in a new window. <b>Header &gt; Top bar visibility</b> controls whether the top bar is shown, hidden or hidden on mobile. <b>Footer &gt; Footer widgets layout</b> sets the footer column count and widths.</p>
</section>